at the Justice Department was quoted.

1593
01:00:58.667 --> 01:01:01.235
So I felt so good about that.

1594
01:01:01.235 --> 01:01:02.105
He basically said,

1595
01:01:02.105 --> 01:01:03.605
it should be assumed that Facebook

1596
01:01:03.605 --> 01:01:05.990
will seek to obtain all the internal work product

1597
01:01:05.990 --> 01:01:08.445
that lay behind the original decisions at the acquisitions,

1598
01:01:08.445 --> 01:01:11.386
did not pose a competitive problem.

1599
01:01:11.386 --> 01:01:12.219
Right.

1600
01:01:12.219 --> 01:01:13.052
Right?

1601
01:01:13.052 --> 01:01:15.219
So this is just beginning,

1602
01:01:16.279 --> 01:01:18.161
but I think it's gonna be fascinating.

1603
01:01:18.161 --> 01:01:19.223
To me, year, right?

1604
01:01:19.223 --> 01:01:22.080
Yeah, it's gonna take years, but to watch this,

1605
01:01:22.080 --> 01:01:23.361
the battle lines are being drawn.

1606
01:01:23.361 --> 01:01:26.483
And if I was a law student right now,

1607
01:01:26.483 --> 01:01:30.025
or a young lawyer looking to be in the middle of the action,

1608
01:01:30.025 --> 01:01:34.386
I think being at the FTC or the justice department right now

1609
01:01:34.386 --> 01:01:36.400
would be an amazing place to be,

1610
01:01:36.400 --> 01:01:40.168
because I think antitrust activity is gonna explode

1611
01:01:40.168 --> 01:01:42.418
with growing political will

1612
01:01:44.433 --> 01:01:47.303
to really look at these gigantic companies

1613
01:01:47.303 --> 01:01:51.827
and the deleterious impact of the power that they wield

1614
01:01:51.827 --> 01:01:54.557
