1615
01:01:54.557 --> 01:01:55.390
What do you think is,

1616
01:01:55.390 --> 01:01:57.220
if they're doing Facebook is now,

1617
01:01:57.220 --> 01:02:01.847
what do you see as some future kind of terrain

1618
01:02:01.847 --> 01:02:04.155
that antitrust lawyers might look at?

1619
01:02:04.155 --> 01:02:06.856
Well, honestly, I think

1620
01:02:06.856 --> 01:02:10.110
that you do need to decouple WhatsApp

1621
01:02:10.110 --> 01:02:11.542
and Instagram from Facebook.

1622
01:02:11.542 --> 01:02:14.504
I think 100% that consumers would be better off

1623
01:02:14.504 --> 01:02:17.868
