Facebook is the easy, first target

1628
01:02:28.815 --> 01:02:32.206
because there's this sensibility around Mark Zuckerberg

1629
01:02:32.206 --> 01:02:35.008
and this kind of the Evil Empire idea.

1630
01:02:35.008 --> 01:02:35.841
Right.

1631
01:02:35.841 --> 01:02:37.655
So that, I'm not surprised

1632
01:02:37.655 --> 01:02:39.100
that they're going after Facebook first,

1633
01:02:39.100 --> 01:02:40.350
but who's next?

1634
01:02:41.185 --> 01:02:43.352
And I would look at Amazon

1635
01:02:45.286 --> 01:02:47.020
and their suite of businesses

1636
01:02:47.020 --> 01:02:50.075
that they Lord control over, AWS.

1637
01:02:50.075 --> 01:02:54.305
They own the biggest cloud service in the world,

1638
01:02:54.305 --> 01:02:55.888
like remember when,

1639
01:02:55.888 --> 01:02:56.721
was it Twitter that?

1640
01:02:56.721 --> 01:02:57.554
No.

1641
01:02:57.554 --> 01:03:01.146
there was a day when you couldn't refresh your podcasts.

1642
01:03:01.146 --> 01:03:02.657
Like all the podcasts were not available

1643
01:03:02.657 --> 01:03:03.742
for a couple of hours.

1644
01:03:03.742 --> 01:03:07.222
Because all of these platforms are backed up on AWS.

1645
01:03:07.222 --> 01:03:10.024
AWS is like the engine behind the internet.

1646
01:03:10.024 --> 01:03:10.857
Right.

1647
01:03:10.857 --> 01:03:13.599
And the idea that that's owned by Amazon,

1648
01:03:13.599 --> 01:03:16.884
this e-commerce website is crazy.

1649
01:03:16.884 --> 01:03:18.666
If you're smart,

1650
01:03:18.666 --> 01:03:22.979
you would prophylactically decouple some of these businesses

1651
01:03:22.979 --> 01:03:25.346
from your core enterprise as a measure,

1652
01:03:25.346 --> 01:03:29.266
as a defense measure against the government going after you.

1653
01:03:29.266 --> 01:03:32.497
And that's something that Kara and Scott Galloway

1654
01:03:32.497 --> 01:03:33.812
we're talking about with respect to Google.

1655
01:03:33.812 --> 01:03:34.843
Scott was saying that,

1656
01:03:34.843 --> 01:03:38.273
if you look at Google, all right,

1657
01:03:38.273 --> 01:03:40.818
