It's not us.

1701
01:05:21.219 --> 01:05:22.554
It's super interesting.

1702
01:05:22.554 --> 01:05:23.387
Right

1703
01:05:23.387 --> 01:05:24.220
And by users,

1704
01:05:24.220 --> 01:05:25.053
I mean we're getting used.

1705
01:05:25.053 --> 01:05:26.904
And it's like, we do use it,

1706
01:05:26.904 --> 01:05:28.452
we do access it.

1707
01:05:28.452 --> 01:05:29.800
Well, the social dilemma is we're the product.

1708
01:05:29.800 --> 01:05:33.226
We're the product and the resource.

1709
01:05:33.226 --> 01:05:37.786
Look, I do think, I use WhatsApp in my reporting.

1710
01:05:37.786 --> 01:05:39.759
I use Facebook Messenger in my reporting.

1711
01:05:39.759 --> 01:05:41.808
I think early on I used Facebook a lot

1712
01:05:41.808 --> 01:05:44.965
to connect with subjects and then to keep in touch

1713
01:05:44.965 --> 01:05:45.952
with people that are overseas,

1714
01:05:45.952 --> 01:05:47.329
that wouldn't otherwise see.

1715
01:05:47.329 --> 01:05:48.696
That became WhatsApp,

1716
01:05:48.696 --> 01:05:51.529
small businesses, local businesses

1717
01:05:52.640 --> 01:05:54.671
are deeply nodded into Instagram.

1718
01:05:54.671 --> 01:05:58.235
The travel industry is deeply nodded to Instagram.

1719
01:05:58.235 --> 01:06:00.452
There are people who this could affect.

1720
01:06:00.452 --> 01:06:04.013
'Cause if to decouple it won't be necessarily

1721
01:06:04.013 --> 01:06:05.555
so seamless probably,

1722
01:06:05.555 --> 01:06:07.707
although maybe it will feel seamless to us,

1723
01:06:07.707 --> 01:06:09.595
but I am in favor obviously,

1724
01:06:09.595 --> 01:06:12.336
of reduced corporate hegemony.

1725
01:06:12.336 --> 01:06:13.169
(laughing)

1726
01:06:13.169 --> 01:06:14.002
Yeah.

1727
01:06:14.002 --> 01:06:14.835
Right.

1728
01:06:14.835 --> 01:06:15.668
Anyway.

1729
01:06:15.668 --> 01:06:17.149
And the idea that the market is better

1730
01:06:17.149 --> 01:06:19.237
with these companies holding on all these things,

1731
