Like this is a progressive thing over many, many years,

3227
02:04:35.381 --> 02:04:37.250
that's informed by genetics, diet, lifestyle,

3228
02:04:37.250 --> 02:04:41.063
all of these things it's complicated, but being ahead of it,

3229
02:04:41.063 --> 02:04:42.145
I think is important.

3230
02:04:42.145 --> 02:04:43.784
David call a cardiologist.

3231
02:04:43.784 --> 02:04:46.547
