3236
02:04:59.492 --> 02:05:01.896
and then they realize like they have to deal with stuff, So

3237
02:05:01.896 --> 02:05:04.297
that's a good idea.

3238
02:05:04.297 --> 02:05:07.138
Of course, there are cases of endurance athletes

3239
02:05:07.138 --> 02:05:10.180
