3242
02:05:13.650 --> 02:05:14.527
how much of this is outlier

3243
02:05:14.527 --> 02:05:18.277
versus versus majority or anything like that.

3244
02:05:20.116 --> 02:05:22.870
But I think it's important to not live your life in fear

3245
02:05:22.870 --> 02:05:26.203
and not use those incidents as an excuse

3246
02:05:28.013 --> 02:05:31.313
to opt out of life or to make excuses for yourself.

3247
02:05:31.313 --> 02:05:34.145
I think it's important to be prudent and responsible

3248
02:05:34.145 --> 02:05:36.655
